   @X0F[@X0EC@X0F]@X0Domment to Sysop
 
     @X0BEnables you to leave a message to the SysOp.  The message is addressed to
     the SysOp and is always a private message.
 
     But this is a PPE that addresses the messages to one of us who can cover
     the topic-related messages.  After you issue the command:

           @X0EC @X0F[@X0CENTER@X0F]
 
     @X0Byou will get a list of topics of what message you plan to enter.  After
     an appropriate topic is chosen, it will be addressed to one of us (random).
 
     After you enter your message, press @X0EESC@X0B and use "@X0ES@X0B" to save the message.
 
     Within 24 hours@X0C (excluding weekends and holidays)@X0B, you should be getting
     a response to your original message.

 
